{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 34, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2^x = 8 in Z/11: x = 3 (mod 10, the order of 2)\n  how: Pohlig-Hellman over 10 = 2 * 5, baby-step giant-step for each prime\n  check: 2^3 = 8\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 34, "ok": true, "cmd": "dlog", "ucas": "dlog 8 base 2 mod 11", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "dlog", "value": "3", "modulus": "10", "base": "2", "method": "Pohlig-Hellman over 10 = 2 * 5, baby-step giant-step for each prime", "headline": "2^x = 8 in Z/11: x = 3 (mod 10, the order of 2)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "2^3 = 8"}], "files": [], "text": "2^x = 8 in Z/11: x = 3 (mod 10, the order of 2)\n  how: Pohlig-Hellman over 10 = 2 * 5, baby-step giant-step for each prime\n  check: 2^3 = 8\n"}, "isError": false}}
